.TH EGGHEAD 1 "April 2026" "egghead 0.1.0" "Egghead Manual"
.SH NAME
egghead \- a personal knowledge base with AI agents that live inside it
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B egghead
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ flags ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B egghead
is a personal knowledge base with AI agents that live inside it.
Plain markdown records are the knowledge graph; agents read, write,
and collaborate within it.
.PP
Running
.B egghead
with no arguments launches the terminal UI (TUI).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B init
First-run setup wizard. Configures records directory, LLM providers,
and the built-in agent model.
.TP
.B serve
Start the web server and MCP HTTP endpoint. Logs to stdout.
.TP
.B mcp
Start the MCP stdio server for editor integration (e.g. Claude Code).
.TP
.B llm \fIsubcommand\fR
Manage LLM providers. Subcommands: list, add, remove, test, models.
.TP
.B agent \fIsubcommand\fR
Manage agents. Subcommands: list, new.
.TP
.B config \fIsubcommand\fR
View or edit configuration. Subcommands: set, path.
.TP
.B doctor
Run diagnostic checks on the installation.
.TP
.B logs
Tail the application log file.
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-config \fIPATH\fR
Override the config file location.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help text.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show version.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
egghead                           # Launch the TUI
egghead init                      # First-run setup
egghead llm add                   # Add an LLM provider
egghead agent new                 # Create a new agent
egghead serve \-\-port 8080        # Run servers on port 8080
.fi
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B EGGHEAD_CONFIG
Override the config file path (same as \-\-config).
.TP
.B ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY, GOOGLE_API_KEY
LLM provider API keys (auto-detected if set).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/egghead/config.yml
Configuration file. See
.BR egghead (5).
.TP
.I ~/.egghead/
Default records directory.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/egghead/egghead.log
Application log file.
